--[[
=====================================================================
  Build The Great Wall - autofarm hub (Airflow UI)
=====================================================================
  1) Auto farm: quarry (Fill) -> wall (Place)
  2) Auto upgrade purchase at the shrine
  3) Auto Bench (Strength)
  4) Auto Treadmill (Speed)
  5) Hot Spring stay (only while the springs are open)

  QoL:
  * Task priorities (OrderList + "Priority" mode)
  * Timed rotation: 30s farm -> 30s run -> 30s gym -> repeat
  * Upgrade autobuy between tasks

  Run: paste into Potassium -> Execute. Toggle the window: RightControl.
=====================================================================
--]]

